OL,3,CMore than 900 customers in Devon told
OL,4,Cto boil their tap water
OL,6,FAround 900 households in Devon are
OL,7,Fbeing advised to boil their tap water
OL,8,Fbefore consuming it.
OL,10,FSouth West Water issued the notice for
OL,11,Fcustomers in Chagford, on the north-
OL,12,Feast edge of Dartmoor on Monday
OL,13,Fmorning.
OL,15,FIt came following what was described
OL,16,Fas a 'complex' repair of a burst water
OL,17,Fmain.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
