OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786454320
OL,3,CMore than 900 customers in Devon told
OL,4,Cto boil their tap water
OL,6,FCustomers have been told the notice
OL,7,Fwill remain in place while water was
OL,8,Ftested and until two days of clear
OL,9,Fresults had been collected.
OL,11,FA bottled water station has been set
OL,12,Fup at Chagford Primary school for
OL,13,Fthose impacted by the notice.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for South West Water
OL,16,Fsaid: "We are advising approximately
OL,17,F900 properties in the area of Chagford
OL,18,Fto boil their tap water.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
