OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786454320
OL,3,CMore than 900 customers in Devon told
OL,4,Cto boil their tap water
OL,6,F"This is a precautionary measure
OL,7,Fwhilst we undertake the necessary
OL,8,Fchecks on the water supply following
OL,9,Fthe complex repair of a burst water
OL,10,Fmain.
OL,12,F"We can't say how long the boil water
OL,13,Fnotice will be in place, but it can
OL,14,Fusually be lifted after 2 days of
OL,15,Fclear results and we therefore expect
OL,16,Fthat customers will be able to use
OL,17,Ftheir supplies as normal later this
OL,18,Fweek.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
