OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786454320
OL,3,CMore than 900 customers in Devon told
OL,4,Cto boil their tap water
OL,6,F"We apologise for the inconvenience
OL,7,Fcaused and are working hard to resolve
OL,8,Fthe issues as quickly as possible."
